.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH geectl-gitea-branch-head 1  "geectl-gitea-branch-head 0.2.2" 
.SH NAME
geectl\-gitea\-branch\-head \- Print the head commit SHA of a branch. Content command: the text IS the SHA, with no header
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgeectl gitea branch\-head\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIOWNER\fR> <\fIREPO\fR> <\fIBRANCH\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Print the head commit SHA of a branch. Content command: the text IS the SHA, with no header
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIOWNER\fR>
The repository owner
.TP
<\fIREPO\fR>
The repository name
.TP
<\fIBRANCH\fR>
The branch name
.SH VERSION
v0.2.2
